. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cGpQ9ELK340Q7kNvwGE1Dhl&_nc_oc=AdpRP72daQiENd2oT0Iem8xK0GYqryXoBSt7S2HdK064JNuKsFzvpxwnSJoyK1umhF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzIhkDIuen-I4SHPjzkMI3ydfIGCMWuPs9WBWNWj9Pklw&oe=69CA743E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SBruoXYu48oQ7kNvwGPYlXf&_nc_oc=AdpW_Zw43cCUr4Fi_VrSWxXyRi4PILY0NieL_ZiQLstKh53djDzR33R3EM8hYaegdbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfygKwyT75E0A5smlvn8izy4UN12_rO4ErslxIOEN3WJlQ&oe=69CA8ADE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x2hLnqJtPmoQ7kNvwF2dfZG&_nc_oc=Adr6AuzkUDzA-XeyJVdI_I5u4XajP6V3-blt8tbwRnvwiN1tju-axYGxZ0uHIwQ-0i4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzpfIIjb4UDhhVW7GxcKbpo-hqlYsueY2vz1aMTaW74Pg&oe=69CA805B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco